				<text_box uid="1" x="612.95" y="1059.36" width="145.928" height="16.875">differentiating control, smoothes </text_box>
				<text_box uid="2" x="883.16" y="1059.3" width="145.928" height="58.6666">integrating control, responds to continuing deviations</text_box>
				<text_box uid="3" x="583.87" y="1121.98" width="260" height="29.6667">PID factors. Negative values dampen deviations, positive values amplify</text_box>
				<text_box uid="4" x="583.87" y="1164.18" width="260" height="58">This is a PID controler
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proportional%E2%80%93integral%E2%80%93derivative_controller</text_box>
				<text_box uid="5" x="420.98" y="1052.43" width="131.667" height="15">Proportional control</text_box>
